    "text": "By Press Release ,\n6 hours ago Kate Hartwyk, candidate for Verona Township Council, will host a daytime “Coffee with Kate” meet and greet on Wednesday, October 7, from 10:30 a.m. to 12:30 p.m. at the Pilgrim Diner, 82 Pompton Avenue, Cedar Grove. The event continues Hartwyk’s series of informal coffee conversations with Verona voters.... Read full article",
